   - **PR evidence hosting:** release assets on the existing release tag `pr-evidence-mascot` (`gh release upload pr-evidence-mascot *.png -R Squidys-Tools/inkling`). URL pattern: `https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/<name>.png`.

3. **Files and Code Sections**

