   **SQU-126:** commit 97f6c59 on branch `squidlee/squ-126-stack-17-tailwind-v4-tokens-base-ui-primitives-app-shell`, pushed. Draft PR https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/176 against main is linked in T3 and as a Linear attachment. SQU-126 is In Progress; CI was pending (CodeQL, Dependency review, Detect changes, Entire Gates; PR scan gate passed). The PR body is at `%TEMP%\squ126\pr-body.md`, with image URLs substituted. Final fixes this segment:

